.TH KUBERNETES(1) kubernetes User Manuals
Eric Paris
Jan 2015

.SH "نام (NAME)"
kubeadm init phase kubeconfig \- Generate all kubeconfig files necessary to establish the control plane and the admin kubeconfig file


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBkubeadm init phase kubeconfig\fP [OPTIONS]


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Generate all kubeconfig files necessary to establish the control plane and the admin kubeconfig file


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--rootfs\fP=""
	The path to the 'real' host root filesystem. This will cause kubeadm to chroot into the provided path.

.PP
\fB--version\fP=false
	--version, --version=raw prints version information and quits; --version=vX.Y.Z... sets the reported version


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBkubeadm-init-phase(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-init-phase-kubeconfig-admin(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-init-phase-kubeconfig-all(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-init-phase-kubeconfig-controller-manager(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-init-phase-kubeconfig-kubelet(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-init-phase-kubeconfig-scheduler(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-init-phase-kubeconfig-super-admin(1)\fP,


.SH "تاریخچه (HISTORY)"
